# RPM spec: RPM Packaging Guide and rpm.org spec file documentation; requirements/languages/rpmspec.md
name     rpmspec spec
keyword  Name Version Release Summary License URL Source0 BuildArch BuildRequires Requires Provides
keyword  Obsoletes Conflicts Group Patch0
builtin  if else endif define global ifarch description prep build install check files changelog
builtin  setup autosetup configure make_build make_install doc license dir config attr
line-comment   #
key-names  :
sigil    %    : builtin
operators  ={}()<>
